window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Fedor is a thief...and a killer.</b></p> <p>Soren changed everything. Life will never be the same. Armed with a magical blade, Fedor has no choice but to accept his first contract as an assassin.</p> <p>His target is the most dangerous man in Nordturm. Is the price high enough for Fedor to kill again? Will he choose between the life of a thief, or the life of an assassin? What will happen to the surviving members of his gang?</p> <p><i>Trial of Thieves</i> is the follow-up to Dawn of Assassins, a gritty dark fantasy tale about friendship, loyalty, and survival.</p> <p><b>Order now because you won’t be able to put this one down.</b></p>"; 
